{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268231-how-does-voting-dead-interact-with-cover","id":268231,"title":"How does Voting Dead Interact with Cover?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-29T07:14:23-07:00","id":268231,"title":"How does Voting Dead Interact with Cover?","content":"A demon with the cover &quot;Detective John Doe&quot; uses the <b>Voting Dead</b> to get the identity of a physician, John Smith. Does the demon cover's core concept, &quot;detective&quot; change to &quot;physician&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3927,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3927-demon15","user":"Demon15","date":". 09-29-2014, 03:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3927-demon15","name":"Demon15","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T18:29:59-07:00","id":268654,"title":"","content":"From my reading of the rules of the Embed, no.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flowers of Hell, Page 104</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> To everyone around her, her name changes and so does all her identification. What doesn\u2019t change, however, is her relationships to human beings. She remains the <b>same person, in the same context,</b> but that Cover ceases to exist while the Embed is in effect.</div> </div> </div> </div> (Emphasis mine)<br /> <br /> Context being skills, core concept, interpersonal relationships, the whole shebang.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Basically, you have your cover John Smith, the Detective. You get the details of Robert Stiff, a recently deceased drug dealer. When you use this embed, you become Robert Stiff the Detective, but anyone looking for John Smith the Detective can't find him - John Smith doesn't exist for that period.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T10:00:57-07:00","id":269222,"title":"","content":"Thank you. That makes sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3927-demon15","name":"Demon15","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}